  "hints": [
    "Think about tracking which items you have already encountered while scanning left to right.",
    "A set checks membership in O(1) average time, unlike scanning a result list with 'not in'. Alternatively, Python dictionaries preserve insertion order.",
    "Pseudocode:\n  seen = set()\n  out = []\n  for item in items:\n      if item not in seen:\n          seen.add(item)\n          out.append(item)\n  return out"
  ],
